00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:25,760
But, people almost never share their winnings

376
00:13:25,760 --> 00:13:28,360
with the first person they meet outside of the experiment.

377
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,240
All right, so what's going on?

378
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,880
Why is it that you're so concerned

379
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:35,560
that you share the money with the other person

