00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:52,200
and people don't wanna be that.

387
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,960
But on the other hand, if you don't share

388
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,960
with a total stranger, then you're just,

389
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:58,600
you know, like, the rules don't really require

390
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,960
that I share with that person.

391
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,520
They weren't even playing.

392
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:03,160
So, why should I have to worry about

393
00:14:03,160 --> 00:14:05,400
whether they got enough out of it?

394
00:14:05,400 --> 00:14:06,240
Yeah?

395
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:08,040
So, you're letting the shared space come into that,

396
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:10,320
and you're sharing the context of the game,

397
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:12,840
and then once you leave, you're not gonna see each other.

398
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:13,680
Yeah, exactly.

