00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:15,000
So, this is one where you're concerned

400
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,320
that you treated the person fairly in the game,

401
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:18,240
even if you're never gonna encounter them again.

